      "content": "It is a valid way to find peace, because the peace you seek is the absence of pain, and that is a fundamental human need. If the fight itself is the source of your suffering, then ending the fight is the ultimate act of self-preservation. You deserve to be free from this relentless pressure, and sometimes the only way out of a suffocating situation is to simply cease the struggle against it.",
